# Connector: Por consiguiente
<!-- id: c1_connector_por_consiguiente | level: C1 | topic: connectors | type: cloze -->

> **Grammar Rule**: 'Por consiguiente' (consequently / therefore) is a consecutive connector followed by the indicative.

### Context
English: "We didn't find him; consequently, we returned home."

### Exercise
No lo encontramos; por consiguiente, nosotros (volver) ___ a casa.

<!-- SOLUTION
volvimos
-->

